    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i want to make sure the memo doesn't sound like we're actually entertaining the idea that inclusivity is bad, you know? like, the benefits of DEI are pretty objectively good for business. how can i phrase the \"cons\" or the pushback in a way that makes it clear those arguments are just outdated or based on misunderstanding, rather than making them sound like valid concerns?",
