      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so basically just treating it as an evolution of norms rather than a debate. but do u think it's actually worth even listing the original arguments of the skeptics in the memo? if their points are mostly just misconceptions or based on old-school views, wouldn't presenting them might give them more weight than they actually deserve?",
